# Service Layer Return Contract

Every Service method MUST return: `['ok' => bool, 'status' => int, 'message' => string]` + optional `data` or `errors`.

- `ok: false, status: 422, errors: [field => reason]` — validation fail
- `ok: false, status: 502, message: generic` — 3rd party API fail  
- `ok: false, status: 404` — not found
- Never throw exceptions out of a Service — catch internally, return `ok: false`
- Services never call `redirect()`, `view()`, or set flash — only return data arrays
- Controller MUST check `$result['ok']` before using `$result['data']`
